e benefits our team. I should **PASS** to support my teammate\'s pressure play and preserve my high cards for when they\'re truly needed.\n\nReason: \nMy teammate is applying pressure with ♥10. By passing, I force the landlord to respond, either burning a high card or conceding control back to my teammate. Since my teammate has fewer cards (10) than the landlord (11) and is closer to winning, I should support their play rather than taking control myself. Preserving my high cards (Q, K, A, BlackJoker) for critical defensive or finishing moments is strategically superior.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
