lord is in an extremely dangerous position with only 3 cards left. I cannot allow them to gain control of the game. My pair of Kings is very strong and likely cannot be beaten by the landlord. Even though I have many cards left, preventing the landlord from winning is the top priority. Taking control now gives me and my teammate the chance to coordinate and prevent a landlord victory.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠K", "♣K"]}'}
